New c '0'
New m '999'

New wname 'ting'
New x '100'
New y '100'
New w '800'
New h '600'

New __Escape_gs.2d.window.create_ARG0 <wname>
New __Escape_gs.2d.window.create_ARG1 <x>
New __Escape_gs.2d.window.create_ARG2 <y>
New __Escape_gs.2d.window.create_ARG3 <w>
New __Escape_gs.2d.window.create_ARG4 <h>

Escape gs.2d.window.create

New msg 'Window created!'
New __Escape_std.io.print_ARG0 <msg>
Escape std.io.print

Func loop
New c "c + 1"
If loop "c > m"
End

Call loop
